(window.XZ_MANUAL_CHAPTERS=window.XZ_MANUAL_CHAPTERS||{})["desktop-app"]="<header class=\"mc-head\"><p class=\"mc-eyebrow\">On your computer<\/p><h2 class=\"mc-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">The XZ Mods app<\/h2><p class=\"mc-lede\">Preparing a USB, building stems, watching the XZ screen live and the tools in the desktop app.<\/p><p class=\"applies\" data-applies=\"computer\">Applies to <b>XZ Mods app on your computer<\/b><\/p><\/header><p>The XZ Mods app runs on your computer. It puts XZ Mods on a USB, makes stems for your tracks, shows the XZ screen live, holds tools for your profile, your library and updates, and sends your reports and ideas to the maintainer. It never formats a drive and never changes your music or your Rekordbox export.<\/p>\n<p>You need 64-bit Windows with WebView2, or a Mac with macOS 14 or later. Making stems needs a Windows computer or an Apple silicon Mac. On an Intel Mac you can still import stems you made elsewhere.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-around-the-app\" data-anchor=\"around-the-app\">Around the app<\/h3>\n<p>The rail on the left has four sections for your work, then the Manual and, at its foot, Feedback. The current one is outlined in yellow.<\/p>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Section<\/th><th>What it is for<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>USB<\/strong><\/td><td>Install or update XZ Mods on a USB, add your DJ profile and games<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Stems<\/strong><\/td><td>Make stems for the tracks on a Rekordbox USB, or import stems you already have<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>XZ Screen<\/strong><\/td><td>Watch the XZ screen on this computer and add it to OBS<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Tools<\/strong><\/td><td>DJ Profile, Repair library, XZ Mods version, Network updates, App updates and About<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Manual<\/strong><\/td><td>This manual, with search, animations and your place in it<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Feedback<\/strong><\/td><td>Report a problem, request a feature or ask a question, and follow what you sent<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>The top of the rail names the player firmware the app prepares USBs for, XDJ-XZ 1.26. The app version is at the bottom.<\/p>\n<p>The app opens as large as its pages need, but never larger than your screen. In a narrow window the rail shows only its icons. Point at one to see its name.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-usb\" data-anchor=\"usb\">USB<\/h3>\n<p>USB is the first page. Plug in your XZ USB, or any USB stick, and the app finds it. When only one USB is connected, it opens by itself.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-1\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/2db12b354e185fa7.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: No USB yet. The app keeps looking, so plug one in. Write to a folder instead… prepares a folder on this computer\"><img src=\"manual/shots/2db12b354e185fa7.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>No USB yet. The app keeps looking, so plug one in. Write to a folder instead… prepares a folder on this computer<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/cbe804e047d5c91f.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Several USBs. Each card says whether XZ Mods is on it yet and whether it holds a Rekordbox export\"><img src=\"manual/shots/cbe804e047d5c91f.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Several USBs. Each card says whether XZ Mods is on it yet and whether it holds a Rekordbox export<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<h4 id=\"m-choose-a-usb-or-a-folder\" data-anchor=\"choose-a-usb-or-a-folder\">Choose a USB or a folder<\/h4>\n<p>The USB list shows every connected USB the app can write XZ Mods to. Any file system works, FAT32 or exFAT, and each card shows it beside the drive letter. Choose a card to open that USB.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-2\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · USB<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/df9f6aefb786ad1e.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Two USBs and a folder to choose from. One line names the drives the app leaves out.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"58.182\" data-y=\"25.000\" aria-label=\"1: USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-2-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"58.182\" data-y=\"47.105\" aria-label=\"2: Write to a folder instead…\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-2-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"69.273\" data-y=\"54.342\" aria-label=\"3: Drives not shown\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-2-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"33.273\" data-y=\"61.447\" aria-label=\"4: Look again\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-2-4\">4<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Two USBs and a folder to choose from. One line names the drives the app leaves out.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-2-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>USB<\/b> <span>A USB the app can write to, with its drive and file system.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-2-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Write to a folder instead…<\/b> <span>Prepares a folder on this computer instead of a USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-2-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Drives not shown<\/b> <span>A read-only USB, or a disk of this computer, with the reason.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-2-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Look again<\/b> <span>Searches for USBs at once.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p><strong>Write to a folder instead…<\/strong> puts the loader and its settings in a folder on this computer. Copy everything in it to the top of a USB stick afterward. Games are added only when you write to a USB itself.<\/p>\n<p>The list comes back whenever you step back from a USB: <strong>Change USB<\/strong> on the dashboard, <strong>Cancel<\/strong> in a guide, or <strong>Esc<\/strong> on the dashboard. The USB you left does not open by itself again until you plug in or remove a drive, so you can pick another one. Its card is still selected, and Enter opens it again.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-the-usb-dashboard\" data-anchor=\"the-usb-dashboard\">The USB dashboard<\/h4>\n<p>Once a USB is open, the page shows one status and one action for it.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · USB<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/3726d5551000cf9f.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A fresh USB. XZ Mods is not on it yet, so the one action is Install XZ Mods.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"13.636\" data-y=\"24.474\" aria-label=\"1: Sections\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"44.727\" data-y=\"15.921\" aria-label=\"2: USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"60.182\" data-y=\"21.316\" aria-label=\"3: Free space\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"89.818\" data-y=\"13.158\" aria-label=\"4: Change USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"55.091\" data-y=\"30.000\" aria-label=\"5: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"44.909\" data-y=\"42.632\" aria-label=\"6: Action\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"33.091\" data-y=\"58.158\" aria-label=\"7: DJ profile\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"54.909\" data-y=\"58.158\" aria-label=\"8: Games\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-8\">8<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"9\" data-x=\"79.091\" data-y=\"58.158\" aria-label=\"9: Stems\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-9\">9<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"10\" data-x=\"39.091\" data-y=\"71.184\" aria-label=\"10: Build\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-10\">10<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"11\" data-x=\"96.727\" data-y=\"78.289\" aria-label=\"11: Four decks\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-11\">11<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"12\" data-x=\"42.182\" data-y=\"87.368\" aria-label=\"12: Show every file\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-12\">12<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"13\" data-x=\"13.818\" data-y=\"88.947\" aria-label=\"13: Feedback\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-3-13\">13<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>A fresh USB. XZ Mods is not on it yet, so the one action is Install XZ Mods.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Sections<\/b> <span>USB, Stems, XZ Screen and Tools.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>USB<\/b> <span>The USB's name and drive.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Free space<\/b> <span>The file system, the free space and a bar of how full the USB is.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Change USB<\/b> <span>Goes back to the USB list, to choose another USB or a folder.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>What XZ Mods found on this USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Action<\/b> <span>The one thing to do next. Here it installs XZ Mods.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>DJ profile<\/b> <span>The active profile on the USB. Add or Edit opens the profile step.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Games<\/b> <span>How many games are on the USB. Choose opens the games list.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"9\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-9\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><div><b>Stems<\/b> <span>How many tracks have stems. Prepare opens the Stems section.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"10\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-10\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><div><b>Build<\/b> <span>The XZ Mods build that goes on the USB. Change opens XZ Mods version.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"11\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-11\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><div><b>Four decks<\/b> <span>How four decks work. It sets nothing up. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"four-decks-in-the-app\">Four decks in the app<\/a>.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"12\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-12\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><div><b>Show every file<\/b> <span>A read-only list of what XZ Mods keeps on this USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"13\" id=\"f-desktop-app-3-13\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><div><b>Feedback<\/b> <span>Reports and ideas for the maintainer. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"feedback\">Feedback<\/a>.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>The status changes with what the app finds:<\/p>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Status<\/th><th>Action<\/th><th>What it means<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>XZ Mods is not on this USB yet<\/td><td><strong>Install XZ Mods<\/strong><\/td><td>Adds the loader, free games and your DJ profile. Music and playlists stay as they are.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Update available<\/td><td><strong>Update USB<\/strong><\/td><td>The USB has an older build. Updating backs up its loader first. <strong>See what changes<\/strong> lists what is new.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Up to date<\/td><td>none<\/td><td>The chosen build is already on this USB.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Choose which XZ Mods build goes on this USB<\/td><td><strong>Use the newest build<\/strong><\/td><td>No build is chosen on this computer yet. The button picks the one that came with the app.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>No XZ Mods build is on this computer yet<\/td><td><strong>Set up mod versions<\/strong><\/td><td>Opens a short guide that finds or imports a build.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-4\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/efbd1211af94371a.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Update available, with the number of changes\"><img src=\"manual/shots/efbd1211af94371a.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Update available, with the number of changes<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/1ee26b9e92ab9915.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Up to date\"><img src=\"manual/shots/1ee26b9e92ab9915.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Up to date<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/b4b108a9d6041483.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: No build chosen yet. Use the newest build picks the one that came with the app\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b4b108a9d6041483.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>No build chosen yet. Use the newest build picks the one that came with the app<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<h4 id=\"m-install-or-update-xz-mods\" data-anchor=\"install-or-update-xz-mods\">Install or update XZ Mods<\/h4>\n<p><strong>Install XZ Mods<\/strong> and <strong>Update USB<\/strong> open a short guide. The steps that do not apply are left out, so the count at the top changes.<\/p>\n<p>Every step ends in the same bar. <strong>Back<\/strong> on the left returns to the step before; from the first step it returns to the dashboard. The way forward is on the right. <strong>Esc<\/strong> does the same as Back. <strong>Cancel<\/strong> at the top leaves the guide without writing anything and shows the USB list, so you can choose another USB or a folder. While the USB is written there is no Back, and the done screen has <strong>Done<\/strong> instead, because a write cannot be undone.<\/p>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><strong>Your DJ profile.<\/strong> Appears when the USB has no profile yet. Type your name and add a logo, or choose <strong>Skip for now<\/strong> and add it later.<\/li><li><strong>Choose the screen the XZ shows.<\/strong> New interface (MODERN) or Standard XDJ-XZ interface (CLASSIC). See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"getting-started\" data-anchor=\"choose-modern-or-classic\">Getting started<\/a>.<\/li><li><strong>Ready to write.<\/strong> A checklist of everything the write will do.<\/li><li><strong>Writing.<\/strong> The progress of each part. Underneath, the app explains four decks while you wait.<\/li><li><strong>Done.<\/strong> What was written, what to do on the XZ, and how four decks work.<\/li><li><strong>Optional support.<\/strong> A thank-you page with a voluntary support link. Every feature works whether you contribute or not.<\/li><\/ol>\n<p>Four decks is not a step of the guide. Nothing about it happens while the USB is written: you set it up at the player, whenever you want. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"four-decks-in-the-app\">Four decks in the app<\/a>.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-5\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/59264e5353367ddf.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Your DJ profile. Skip for now leaves it for later\"><img src=\"manual/shots/59264e5353367ddf.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Your DJ profile. Skip for now leaves it for later<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Install XZ Mods<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/cf9424f7a5367a13.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Choose the screen the XZ shows. The selected card plays a short clip of it.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"71.818\" data-y=\"3.947\" aria-label=\"1: Progress\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"95.091\" data-y=\"3.947\" aria-label=\"2: Cancel\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"44.182\" data-y=\"59.474\" aria-label=\"3: New interface\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"92.000\" data-y=\"43.684\" aria-label=\"4: Standard XDJ-XZ interface\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"71.091\" data-y=\"73.684\" aria-label=\"5: Switch later\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"33.818\" data-y=\"95.789\" aria-label=\"6: Back\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"85.909\" data-y=\"95.789\" aria-label=\"7: Next\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-6-7\">7<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Choose the screen the XZ shows. The selected card plays a short clip of it.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Progress<\/b> <span>Which step you are on.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Cancel<\/b> <span>Leaves the guide. Nothing is written.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>New interface<\/b> <span>MODERN. XZ Mods draws the whole player screen.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Standard XDJ-XZ interface<\/b> <span>CLASSIC. The player's own screen with MODS added. Classic themes can restyle it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Switch later<\/b> <span>How to change your mind on the player.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Back<\/b> <span>The step before. From the first step, the dashboard.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-6-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Next<\/b> <span>The next step.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--note\"><b>Note<\/b><p>The two small pictures under the cards show an older version of the MODS menu. On the player, INTERFACE is on the <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"screen-and-themes\" data-anchor=\"modern-and-classic\">SCREEN<\/a> page.<\/p><\/aside>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Install XZ Mods<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/d5c03db8910629d0.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Ready to write, with Change games open. Under the list, a line says music, playlists and prepared stems are never touched.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"52.727\" data-y=\"29.868\" aria-label=\"1: Loader\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"64.182\" data-y=\"35.921\" aria-label=\"2: Games\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"49.091\" data-y=\"41.974\" aria-label=\"3: Interface\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"43.455\" data-y=\"50.526\" aria-label=\"4: Settings file\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"33.455\" data-y=\"56.842\" aria-label=\"5: Change games\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"94.545\" data-y=\"65.921\" aria-label=\"6: Add all free games\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"58.000\" data-y=\"72.895\" aria-label=\"7: Game state\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"80.909\" data-y=\"73.026\" aria-label=\"8: Add\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-8\">8<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"9\" data-x=\"33.818\" data-y=\"95.789\" aria-label=\"9: Back\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-9\">9<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"10\" data-x=\"80.909\" data-y=\"95.789\" aria-label=\"10: Write to USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-7-10\">10<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Ready to write, with Change games open. Under the list, a line says music, playlists and prepared stems are never touched.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Loader<\/b> <span>Adds the XZ Mods loader, or backs up and updates it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Games<\/b> <span>The free games that will be copied.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Interface<\/b> <span>The screen the XZ starts with.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Settings file<\/b> <span>A USB without settings gets a new settings file.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Change games<\/b> <span>Opens or hides the games list.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Add all free games<\/b> <span>Ticks every download. None unticks the ones not on the USB yet.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Game state<\/b> <span>WILL ADD, NOT ON USB, or already on the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Add<\/b> <span>Ticks one game. The size is what it adds to the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"9\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-9\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><div><b>Back<\/b> <span>The step before.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"10\" id=\"f-desktop-app-7-10\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><div><b>Write to USB<\/b> <span>Writes everything in the checklist.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Beat Arcade, Wave Rider, Rhythm Lab and Static Surfer are built into the loader and always come with it. Doom shareware, Chex Quest and Freedoom Phase 2 are free downloads that the app checks and copies to <code>VJTOOLS\\Games<\/code> on the USB. A fresh USB gets every free game unless you untick it. An update keeps the games the USB already has and adds none on its own. Under the checklist, <strong>Eject the USB when writing finishes<\/strong> ejects it for you so you can take it straight to the XZ.<\/p>\n<p>Press <strong>Write to USB<\/strong> in the bar under the checklist. If a newer build needs a setting changed on the USB, the app first asks in <strong>Adjust USB settings for this version<\/strong>. It saves a copy of the settings file first and puts it back if the loader write fails.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Install XZ Mods<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/e6be525dd2d5f44a.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Your USB is ready. Four decks and the optional support link follow further down.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"68.818\" data-y=\"23.684\" aria-label=\"1: Result\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-8-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"52.273\" data-y=\"32.368\" aria-label=\"2: What was written\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-8-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"33.818\" data-y=\"41.974\" aria-label=\"3: On the XZ\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-8-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"44.545\" data-y=\"72.895\" aria-label=\"4: Four decks\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-8-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"73.455\" data-y=\"95.789\" aria-label=\"5: Done\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-8-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"96.545\" data-y=\"95.789\" aria-label=\"6: Eject USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-8-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Your USB is ready. Four decks and the optional support link follow further down.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Result<\/b> <span>Your USB is ready, or Finished, with something to check.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>What was written<\/b> <span>One line per part. A game that did not download says why.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>On the XZ<\/b> <span>What to do with the USB next, and how to switch between CLASSIC and MODERN with the rekordbox button above LINK.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Four decks<\/b> <span>How four decks work. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"four-decks-in-the-app\">Four decks in the app<\/a>.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Done<\/b> <span>Back to the dashboard.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-8-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Eject USB<\/b> <span>Ejects the USB so you can unplug it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Under Four decks, <strong>Support XZ Mods (optional)<\/strong> opens the optional support page, and <strong>Eject the USB by itself next time<\/strong> ejects the USB on its own after the next write.<\/p>\n<p>If a game download failed, <strong>Retry the failed games<\/strong> tries only those, and the USB is not ejected until you have. When the write also saved a DJ profile, <strong>Make the profile track<\/strong> opens the profile track steps.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-9\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/2ae6c1305f8578e2.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Writing. The progress of each part shows inside the guide\"><img src=\"manual/shots/2ae6c1305f8578e2.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Writing. The progress of each part shows inside the guide<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/260a5764d8d03ed1.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"760\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: The USB is ejected and can be unplugged\"><img src=\"manual/shots/260a5764d8d03ed1.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>The USB is ejected and can be unplugged<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<h4 id=\"m-four-decks-in-the-app\" data-anchor=\"four-decks-in-the-app\">Four decks in the app <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"four-decks\">Four decks<\/a> is set up at the player, so the app explains it rather than asking you to do anything. The USB list and the dashboard show a <strong>Four decks<\/strong> row. While a USB is written, and again on the done screen, a Four decks section shows the cable animation and the three things to do at the player.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-10\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Install XZ Mods<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/039274c55e8e8269.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Four decks section on the done screen.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"44.545\" data-y=\"6.711\" aria-label=\"1: Four decks\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-10-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"50.909\" data-y=\"39.474\" aria-label=\"2: Cable animation\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-10-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"91.455\" data-y=\"50.921\" aria-label=\"3: Pause cable animation\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-10-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"65.636\" data-y=\"66.053\" aria-label=\"4: At the player\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-10-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"43.455\" data-y=\"72.763\" aria-label=\"5: How four decks work\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-10-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The Four decks section on the done screen.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-10-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Four decks<\/b> <span>Experimental. Nothing to do now. You set it up at the player when you want it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-10-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Cable animation<\/b> <span>The loopback cable from the rear USB-B socket to a top port. The animation shows USB 1; USB 2 works too.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-10-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Pause cable animation<\/b> <span>Stops and starts the animation. With reduced motion turned on, the app shows a still picture.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-10-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>At the player<\/b> <span>Cable from the rear USB-B socket to top USB 1 or 2, music in the other top port (a stick, or one USB 2.0 hub), and CH3 and CH4 set to USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-10-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>How four decks work<\/b> <span>Opens the <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"four-decks\">Four decks<\/a> chapter of this manual.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p><strong>How four decks work<\/strong> and the <strong>Four decks<\/strong> row both open the Four decks chapter of this manual. If the build just written has no four-deck engine, the section says so and offers <strong>Choose the four-deck build<\/strong>, which opens the four-deck build choice in <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"xz-mods-version\">XZ Mods version<\/a>. Save it, then update the USB.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-stems\" data-anchor=\"stems\">Stems<\/h3>\n<p>Stems makes vocal, harmonic and drum stems for the tracks on your Rekordbox USB and writes them beside each track. Plug in the USB you export to from Rekordbox. The app lists every track on it. Your tracks and your Rekordbox export stay as they are.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Stems<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/fb36dfee25c6bf0d.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Twelve tracks selected and the stem engine set up.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"32.273\" data-y=\"12.500\" aria-label=\"1: USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"51.636\" data-y=\"15.972\" aria-label=\"2: Tracks\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"60.182\" data-y=\"22.639\" aria-label=\"3: Estimate\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"85.000\" data-y=\"12.778\" aria-label=\"4: Prepare\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"70.182\" data-y=\"22.222\" aria-label=\"5: Engine\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"42.273\" data-y=\"26.389\" aria-label=\"6: Tabs\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"81.818\" data-y=\"29.583\" aria-label=\"7: Search\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"90.636\" data-y=\"26.111\" aria-label=\"8: Import stems\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-8\">8<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"9\" data-x=\"22.273\" data-y=\"62.083\" aria-label=\"9: Select\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-9\">9<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"10\" data-x=\"77.455\" data-y=\"61.944\" aria-label=\"10: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-10\">10<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"11\" data-x=\"96.818\" data-y=\"61.944\" aria-label=\"11: Details\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-11-11\">11<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Twelve tracks selected and the stem engine set up.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>USB<\/b> <span>The Rekordbox USB. Its menu also offers Choose a folder and Look for USBs again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Tracks<\/b> <span>How many tracks the USB holds and how many have stems.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Estimate<\/b> <span>How many tracks you selected, about how much space their stems take and what is left after.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Prepare<\/b> <span>Makes stems for the selected tracks. The label counts them.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Engine<\/b> <span>The stem engine and the quality in use. Change sets another quality.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Tabs<\/b> <span>Show All, Missing, Ready, Can't prepare, or only the Selected tracks.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Search<\/b> <span>Finds a title or artist.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Import stems<\/b> <span>Brings in stems you made elsewhere.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"9\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-9\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><div><b>Select<\/b> <span>Ticks a track. The box in the header ticks every Missing track in view.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"10\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-10\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>Ready, Missing, Not yet, No audio file, Preparing, Queued, Failed or Damaged.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"11\" id=\"f-desktop-app-11-11\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><div><b>Details<\/b> <span>Opens the track's details.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Status<\/th><th>What it means<\/th><th>What to do<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Ready<\/td><td>Stems are on the USB<\/td><td>Nothing. Open the details to Verify them<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Missing<\/td><td>No stems yet<\/td><td>Select it and prepare<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Not yet<\/td><td>XZ Mods cannot prepare this format yet, such as AIFF<\/td><td>Export the track as WAV, FLAC or MP3<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>No audio file<\/td><td>The track's file is not on the USB<\/td><td>Export the track from Rekordbox again<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Failed<\/td><td>Preparing stopped, with the reason under it<\/td><td>Fix the reason, then <strong>Retry<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Damaged<\/td><td>Verify found a broken stem page<\/td><td>Select it and prepare it again<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Prepare again<\/td><td>Made by an older version<\/td><td>Open the details and choose <strong>Prepare again<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>A batch holds up to 100 tracks. The estimate turns amber when space gets tight and red when the selection does not fit. The button then reads <strong>Prepare N that fit<\/strong> and prepares the tracks in order until the next one would not fit.<\/p>\n<p>While a batch runs, each row moves from Queued to Preparing to Ready, and the bar shows the track, the step and about how long is left. The first time on a new computer it says <strong>Timing this computer<\/strong> until it has measured. <strong>Cancel<\/strong> stops within a second. Finished tracks are kept. When the batch ends, the bar offers the next step.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-12\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/8e69e3142608f716.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: No Rekordbox USB found. Connect a USB opens a short guide to find or choose one\"><img src=\"manual/shots/8e69e3142608f716.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>No Rekordbox USB found. Connect a USB opens a short guide to find or choose one<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/f84faa4b8eb2b773.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: The selection does not fit. Prepare 7 that fit\"><img src=\"manual/shots/f84faa4b8eb2b773.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>The selection does not fit. Prepare 7 that fit<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/a27577bab23dea7e.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: A batch running, with the step and the time left\"><img src=\"manual/shots/a27577bab23dea7e.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>A batch running, with the step and the time left<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/576e464ae08f84ad.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Finished with one failure. Retry 1 failed\"><img src=\"manual/shots/576e464ae08f84ad.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Finished with one failure. Retry 1 failed<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>After a batch<\/th><th>What it offers<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>A track failed<\/td><td><strong>Retry N failed<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>You pressed Cancel<\/td><td><strong>Prepare N remaining<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>The USB was unplugged<\/td><td><strong>Continue<\/strong>. Nothing is left half-written<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>The USB filled up<\/td><td><strong>Choose fewer tracks<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>Open a row for its details. A Ready track shows who prepared it and offers <strong>Verify<\/strong>, which reads every stem page without changing the USB, <strong>Import stems<\/strong> to replace them, and <strong>Prepare again<\/strong>. Prepare again keeps the current stems until the new ones pass their check.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-set-up-the-stem-engine\" data-anchor=\"set-up-the-stem-engine\">Set up the stem engine<\/h4>\n<p>The first time, the button reads <strong>Set up stem engine<\/strong>. It opens a short guide that ends on a working engine.<\/p>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><strong>Check.<\/strong> The app looks at this computer's graphics card or processor.<\/li><li><strong>Choose.<\/strong> Pick a quality. The recommended one is marked for this computer.<\/li><li><strong>Install.<\/strong> The app downloads what the engine needs once and checks every file.<\/li><li><strong>Test.<\/strong> It separates 30 seconds of your first selected track and tells you how long a whole track will take. Nothing is written to the USB.<\/li><\/ol>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Quality<\/th><th>Use it for<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Balanced<\/td><td>The best quality. Recommended with a graphics card or Apple silicon<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Fast<\/td><td>Good separation in about half the time. Recommended without a graphics card<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Light<\/td><td>Computers without a graphics card and with little memory. Vocals bleed more<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>If setup cannot finish, it names the one reason and offers the fix. For example, when the graphics driver is too old, <strong>Use the processor<\/strong> sets up the engine on the processor instead.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-13\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/a07eb096ed4d0595.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Set up stem engine replaces Prepare until the engine is set up\"><img src=\"manual/shots/a07eb096ed4d0595.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Set up stem engine replaces Prepare until the engine is set up<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/0ea6c185b46d9617.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Step 1. The graphics card the engine will use\"><img src=\"manual/shots/0ea6c185b46d9617.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Step 1. The graphics card the engine will use<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/c6986b7bd7f830cd.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Step 2. Choose quality\"><img src=\"manual/shots/c6986b7bd7f830cd.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Step 2. Choose quality<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/839e915161d4534f.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Step 3. What it downloads, and the free space on this computer\"><img src=\"manual/shots/839e915161d4534f.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Step 3. What it downloads, and the free space on this computer<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/92541459de7baa7a.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Step 4. The test result, then Prepare 12 tracks\"><img src=\"manual/shots/92541459de7baa7a.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Step 4. The test result, then Prepare 12 tracks<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/b2688310cdac9bbb.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: The driver is too old. Use the processor, or update the driver and check again\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b2688310cdac9bbb.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>The driver is too old. Use the processor, or update the driver and check again<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<h4 id=\"m-import-stems-you-already-have\" data-anchor=\"import-stems-you-already-have\">Import stems you already have<\/h4>\n<p>Choose <strong>Import stems<\/strong> in the toolbar, or <strong>Import stems made elsewhere<\/strong> in a track's details. Drop stem files or a ZIP into the window, or choose files. WAV, FLAC, MP3 and AIFF sets work.<\/p>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><strong>Add files.<\/strong> From the toolbar, also pick which track the stems are for.<\/li><li><strong>Check.<\/strong> The app places each file on VOCALS, DRUMS or HARMONICS by its name and lines the stems up with the track on your USB. Change any <strong>Goes to<\/strong> choice you disagree with. <strong>Leave out<\/strong> skips a file.<\/li><li><strong>Write.<\/strong> <strong>Write stems to USB<\/strong> writes the stems and checks them.<\/li><\/ol>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-desktop-app-14\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/52c66391687d11d8.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Two files need a place. Play a file to hear what it is\"><img src=\"manual/shots/52c66391687d11d8.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Two files need a place. Play a file to hear what it is<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/d00eefaa746eb46a.webp\" data-w=\"1100\" data-h=\"720\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Stems written and checked\"><img src=\"manual/shots/d00eefaa746eb46a.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>Stems written and checked<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<p>A vocals and instrumental pair needs the stem engine to pull the drums out of the instrumental. If the engine is not set up yet, the import offers <strong>Set up stem engine<\/strong> and carries on afterward. To use stems on the player, see <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"stems\">Stems<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-xz-screen\" data-anchor=\"xz-screen\">XZ Screen <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>XZ Screen shows the XDJ-XZ screen on this computer over the network, so you can add it to an OBS scene. It sends the picture only, no audio, and the XZ keeps all its controls.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-15\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · XZ Screen<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/04b3f88fca91ed76.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Before the first connection.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"32.364\" data-y=\"22.895\" aria-label=\"1: Set up Live Streamer\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-15-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"60.727\" data-y=\"26.711\" aria-label=\"2: Stop stream and Fullscreen\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-15-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"32.909\" data-y=\"32.105\" aria-label=\"3: Stream color\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-15-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"50.909\" data-y=\"45.658\" aria-label=\"4: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-15-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"66.818\" data-y=\"76.974\" aria-label=\"5: Screen\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-15-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Before the first connection.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-15-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Set up Live Streamer<\/b> <span>Opens the three-step connection guide.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-15-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Stop stream and Fullscreen<\/b> <span>Work once the XZ is connected.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-15-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Stream color<\/b> <span>8-bit with 256 colors, or 16-bit with the original colors. A change applies when you reconnect.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-15-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>What the connection is doing, and the frame rate it measures.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-15-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Screen<\/b> <span>The XZ screen at 800 × 480 once it is connected.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Set up Live Streamer<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b544f0a6c16766cb.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The connection guide.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"35.909\" data-y=\"31.711\" aria-label=\"1: Look again\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-16-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"32.273\" data-y=\"37.237\" aria-label=\"2: XZ address\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-16-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"35.909\" data-y=\"46.316\" aria-label=\"3: Network details\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-16-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"39.091\" data-y=\"68.026\" aria-label=\"4: Open USB setup\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-16-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"44.364\" data-y=\"87.237\" aria-label=\"5: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-16-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"40.909\" data-y=\"93.421\" aria-label=\"6: Connect and Close\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-16-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The connection guide.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Look again<\/b> <span>Searches the network for the XZ again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>XZ address<\/b> <span>Found by itself, or type the address the XZ shows.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Network details<\/b> <span>The ports a firewall must allow, UDP 50006 and TCP 50010.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Open USB setup<\/b> <span>Older USB loaders have no screen service. Update the loader on the USB page.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>Found your XZ, still looking, or what stopped it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-16-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Connect and Close<\/b> <span>The first picture from the XZ confirms the connection.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li>Connect this computer and the XZ to the same network, for example the same router or a network cable between them.<\/li><li>Choose <strong>Set up Live Streamer<\/strong>. The app looks for the XZ at once.<\/li><li>If the guide asks, update the USB loader on the USB page, then switch the XZ off and on with both decks stopped. The guide never restarts the XZ.<\/li><li>Choose <strong>Connect<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ol>\n<p>To use the picture in OBS, add a <strong>Browser<\/strong> source, paste the <strong>OBS Browser Source URL<\/strong>, and set its width to <strong>800<\/strong> and height to <strong>480<\/strong>. <strong>Copy OBS URL<\/strong> copies it. Keep the app running. The URL works on this computer only and changes when you reconnect.<\/p>\n<p>Tick <strong>Show a logo while browsing USB<\/strong> to cover the stream with the XZ Mods logo while you browse your USB. The play screen comes back on its own. Menus, custom themes and screens the app does not recognise stay covered.<\/p>\n<p>With an older USB loader the picture updates about once a second and the status says it is not performance video. <strong>Update the USB loader<\/strong> appears beside it.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-tools\" data-anchor=\"tools\">Tools<\/h3>\n<p>Tools holds everything you need less often, grouped by what it works on: your USB, your XZ and this app. <strong>Tools<\/strong> in the top left of each tool goes back to this list.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Tools<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/067ba1c20b5b6507.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Every tool, in three groups.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"36.818\" data-y=\"18.158\" aria-label=\"1: DJ Profile\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"76.364\" data-y=\"18.158\" aria-label=\"2: Repair library\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"41.182\" data-y=\"31.579\" aria-label=\"3: XZ Mods version\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"41.455\" data-y=\"50.000\" aria-label=\"4: Network updates\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"38.545\" data-y=\"68.158\" aria-label=\"5: App updates\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"71.727\" data-y=\"68.158\" aria-label=\"6: About\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"13.636\" data-y=\"86.184\" aria-label=\"7: Feedback\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-17-7\">7<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Every tool, in three groups.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>DJ Profile<\/b> <span>Your name and logo on the XZ, and the profile track.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Repair library<\/b> <span>Fixes a Rekordbox USB the XZ cannot read.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>XZ Mods version<\/b> <span>Picks which build goes on your USB, or imports one.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Network updates<\/b> <span>Sends the newest XZ Mods to XZs on your network.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>App updates<\/b> <span>Checks for a newer app.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>About<\/b> <span>The app, its maker, links, disclaimers and open-source licenses.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-17-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Feedback<\/b> <span>Reports and ideas are not in Tools. They have their own section at the foot of the rail.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<h4 id=\"m-dj-profile\" data-anchor=\"dj-profile\">DJ Profile<\/h4>\n<p>DJ Profile makes and edits the profiles on a USB. A profile is your name, logo and colour. The XZ shows each profile as a logo tile, and the active one is the DJ the XZ and VJ software on the same network see. Profiles are saved on the USB only. Nothing is uploaded. To use them on the player, see <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"connect\" data-anchor=\"dj-profile\">Connect and DJ profiles<\/a>.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · DJ Profile<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/e3ff230309775778.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A new profile.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"30.909\" data-y=\"22.954\" aria-label=\"1: DJ name\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-18-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"48.182\" data-y=\"54.304\" aria-label=\"2: Logo\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-18-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"52.000\" data-y=\"69.288\" aria-label=\"3: Colour\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-18-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"70.727\" data-y=\"22.954\" aria-label=\"4: On the XZ\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-18-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"77.455\" data-y=\"54.091\" aria-label=\"5: What VJ software sees\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-18-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"45.727\" data-y=\"80.128\" aria-label=\"6: More\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-18-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>A new profile.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>DJ name<\/b> <span>Your name as it should read on the XZ.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Logo<\/b> <span>A PNG or JPEG up to 8 MB. A transparent PNG looks best. You can add alternate logos.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Colour<\/b> <span>The profile colour. The first swatch matches the USB's colour in rekordbox.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>On the XZ<\/b> <span>The header and the logo tile as the XZ draws them.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>What VJ software sees<\/b> <span>Your name and links as VJ software reads them.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-18-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>More<\/b> <span>An optional tagline, links and more.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · DJ Profile<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/48592c7a7712da1b.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"903\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The profiles on a USB after a save.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"95.455\" data-y=\"20.598\" aria-label=\"1: Create profile track\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-19-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"49.091\" data-y=\"48.173\" aria-label=\"2: Profile tile\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-19-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"39.091\" data-y=\"60.797\" aria-label=\"3: Active\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-19-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"47.273\" data-y=\"60.797\" aria-label=\"4: Edit\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-19-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"37.727\" data-y=\"68.217\" aria-label=\"5: New DJ profile\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-19-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"45.909\" data-y=\"75.305\" aria-label=\"6: Profile track\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-19-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The profiles on a USB after a save.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Create profile track<\/b> <span>The next step after a save.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Profile tile<\/b> <span>One tile per profile.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Active<\/b> <span>The profile the XZ uses.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Edit<\/b> <span>Changes this profile.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>New DJ profile<\/b> <span>Adds another profile to the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-19-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Profile track<\/b> <span>A track that carries your profile to players that cannot read extra files.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Some newer players block reading extra files from the USB. A profile track is a silent song that carries your name, logos and links, so it reaches them through rekordbox like any other track.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-20\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · DJ Profile<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/65d25a567a67fd9e.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Making a profile track.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"56.818\" data-y=\"22.237\" aria-label=\"1: Steps\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-20-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"51.364\" data-y=\"39.737\" aria-label=\"2: This computer\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-20-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"89.000\" data-y=\"38.421\" aria-label=\"3: Choose folder\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-20-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"46.364\" data-y=\"47.763\" aria-label=\"4: Copy on the USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-20-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"47.727\" data-y=\"57.500\" aria-label=\"5: Create or Cancel\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-20-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Making a profile track.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-20-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Steps<\/b> <span>Where, Create, then Add it to rekordbox.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-20-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>This computer<\/b> <span>Saves the track in your Music folder, ready for rekordbox.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-20-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Choose folder<\/b> <span>Saves the track somewhere else.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-20-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Copy on the USB<\/b> <span>Also puts a copy in your profile folder on the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-20-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Create or Cancel<\/b> <span>Makes the track, or leaves without one.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<h4 id=\"m-repair-library\" data-anchor=\"repair-library\">Repair library<\/h4>\n<p>Repair library checks the Rekordbox library on a USB the XZ cannot read. It can clear invalid unused pages and reconnect playback history pages that survived. It keeps track records, playlists, music and prepared stems.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-21\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Repair library<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/192e5f3ad7d4e5fe.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 1, choose the USB.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"38.182\" data-y=\"28.816\" aria-label=\"1: USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-21-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"95.636\" data-y=\"31.842\" aria-label=\"2: Choose folder and Find USBs\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-21-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"37.273\" data-y=\"44.211\" aria-label=\"3: Connect a USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-21-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"60.455\" data-y=\"48.684\" aria-label=\"4: Read only\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-21-4\">4<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Step 1, choose the USB.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-21-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>USB<\/b> <span>The Rekordbox USB or a folder holding a copy of it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-21-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Choose folder and Find USBs<\/b> <span>Picks a folder, or looks for USBs again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-21-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Connect a USB<\/b> <span>Appears when no USB is found. Opens a short guide to connect one.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-21-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Read only<\/b> <span>Checking only reads the library.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><strong>Choose the USB.<\/strong> Then choose <strong>Check library<\/strong>.<\/li><li><strong>Library check.<\/strong> The verdict, what the library holds and what is wrong. <strong>Save report<\/strong> keeps the result on this computer.<\/li><li><strong>Repair plan.<\/strong> What changes and what stays the same. <strong>Back up and repair<\/strong> backs up the library files first.<\/li><\/ol>\n<p>If rekordbox is open on this computer, the check says so and offers <strong>Prepare for repair<\/strong>. Close rekordbox so both apps do not write at the same time, then check again. After a repair, <strong>Undo this repair<\/strong> puts the library files back exactly as they were before it.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-network-updates\" data-anchor=\"network-updates\">Network updates <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h4>\n<p>Network updates sends the build installed on this computer to XZs on your local network. Each XZ checks the signed update, saves it on its USB and starts it at the next boot.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-22\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Network updates<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/a59a085a1741d54c.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The update server, before it starts.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"95.727\" data-y=\"25.263\" aria-label=\"1: Choose mod version\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-22-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"24.091\" data-y=\"62.105\" aria-label=\"2: Detect adapters\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-22-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"95.455\" data-y=\"54.079\" aria-label=\"3: XZ network adapter\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-22-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"52.727\" data-y=\"61.184\" aria-label=\"4: Start update server\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-22-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"23.818\" data-y=\"67.368\" aria-label=\"5: On the XZ\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-22-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The update server, before it starts.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-22-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Choose mod version<\/b> <span>A USB built with Keep this version on the USB ignores network updates. Change that here.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-22-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Detect adapters<\/b> <span>Lists this computer's network connections.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-22-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>XZ network adapter<\/b> <span>The connection that reaches the XZ.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-22-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Start update server<\/b> <span>Offers the update on that network until you cancel.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-22-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>On the XZ<\/b> <span>What to do on the player.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li>Prepare or update the USB loader once, so it supports network updates.<\/li><li>Choose <strong>Detect adapters<\/strong>, then the adapter connected to the XZ network.<\/li><li>Choose <strong>Start update server<\/strong>.<\/li><li>On the XZ, open <strong>CONNECT<\/strong> › <strong>UPDATES<\/strong>, then download the update. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"connect\" data-anchor=\"updates-over-the-network\">Updates over the network<\/a>.<\/li><li>Switch the XZ off and on when you are ready to start the new version.<\/li><\/ol>\n<p>Network updates change XZ Mods and the game engine. They keep your music and the original USB loader, so you can always go back. <strong>Cancel<\/strong> stops the server.<\/p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--note\"><b>Note<\/b><p>The app's step 3 still says MODS › Extras › Network updates. On the player the page is CONNECT › UPDATES.<\/p><\/aside>\n<h4 id=\"m-xz-mods-version\" data-anchor=\"xz-mods-version\">XZ Mods version<\/h4>\n<p>XZ Mods version chooses which build goes on your USB the next time you install or update it. Saving your choice does not write to any USB.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · XZ Mods version<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/e8428c18e88d6c7c.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The saved build choice.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"80.455\" data-y=\"16.842\" aria-label=\"1: Verified\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"39.091\" data-y=\"30.000\" aria-label=\"2: Saved choice\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"58.636\" data-y=\"34.737\" aria-label=\"3: Details\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"77.455\" data-y=\"48.421\" aria-label=\"4: Change mod version\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"44.545\" data-y=\"54.211\" aria-label=\"5: Keep this version on the USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"47.909\" data-y=\"62.632\" aria-label=\"6: Save choice and Import a build\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"39.273\" data-y=\"74.079\" aria-label=\"7: Set up four decks\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"42.273\" data-y=\"99.474\" aria-label=\"8: Choose USB to update\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-23-8\">8<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The saved build choice.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Verified<\/b> <span>Says whether the build was checked on a real XDJ-XZ.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Saved choice<\/b> <span>The build your next install or update uses.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Details<\/b> <span>Its channel, whether it stays on the USB and where it came from.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Change mod version<\/b> <span>Every build on this computer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Keep this version on the USB<\/b> <span>A loader built with this on skips network updates, so the USB stays on this build.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Save choice and Import a build<\/b> <span>Saves the choice, or adds a build from a folder.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Set up four decks<\/b> <span>Chooses the included four-deck build.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-23-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Choose USB to update<\/b> <span>Restores or updates a loader by hand.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Lower on the page:<\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>Restore or update a loader by hand<\/strong> updates the loader on a USB you choose and keeps a backup of the old one. Music and saved settings stay in place.<\/li><li><strong>Prepare from a downloaded firmware file<\/strong> builds a loader from an official XDJ-XZ 1.26 firmware file into a folder you choose.<\/li><li><strong>Game downloads<\/strong> downloads and checks the free games and copies them to a USB. Use it to retry a download that failed during setup.<\/li><\/ul>\n<p><strong>Import a build<\/strong> takes a prepared XZ Mods <code>resources<\/code> folder, or a whole XZ Mods app folder that holds one. The app checks every file before it adds the build. Imported builds are not checked on a real XDJ-XZ.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-app-updates\" data-anchor=\"app-updates\">App updates<\/h4>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-24\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · App updates<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/043686c1866322b0.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The app is up to date.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"39.091\" data-y=\"15.526\" aria-label=\"1: Version\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-24-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"32.273\" data-y=\"19.737\" aria-label=\"2: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-24-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"39.545\" data-y=\"34.868\" aria-label=\"3: Check for updates\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-24-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"35.000\" data-y=\"53.289\" aria-label=\"4: What&#x27;s new\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-24-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"49.545\" data-y=\"77.237\" aria-label=\"5: Other downloads\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-24-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The app is up to date.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-24-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Version<\/b> <span>The app version on this computer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-24-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>Up to date, or the newer version on offer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-24-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Check for updates<\/b> <span>Checks now. Download and install update appears when there is one.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-24-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>What's new<\/b> <span>The release notes.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-24-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Other downloads<\/b> <span>The installer and the portable ZIP.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>On Windows the app checks for updates by itself at launch and shows <strong>Review update<\/strong> at the top of the page when one is ready. The installer updates the app and opens it again. Mac versions download from the release page.<\/p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--caution\"><b>Caution<\/b><p>Updating the app does not change the loader on your USB. Open the USB page afterward and choose <strong>Update USB<\/strong>.<\/p><\/aside>\n<h4 id=\"m-about\" data-anchor=\"about\">About<\/h4>\n<p>About says what XZ Mods is and who makes it, and gathers the links, the disclaimers and the open-source licenses in one place.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · About<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/af784a6ca3cce1b9.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1154\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"About.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"58.182\" data-y=\"11.698\" aria-label=\"1: Version\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"70.455\" data-y=\"13.778\" aria-label=\"2: Maker\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"56.364\" data-y=\"24.523\" aria-label=\"3: App updates and release notes\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"33.182\" data-y=\"31.802\" aria-label=\"4: The maker\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"67.455\" data-y=\"31.802\" aria-label=\"5: Links\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"73.182\" data-y=\"57.712\" aria-label=\"6: Feedback\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"83.636\" data-y=\"62.305\" aria-label=\"7: Support XZ Mods (optional)\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"34.364\" data-y=\"70.451\" aria-label=\"8: Disclaimers\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-8\">8<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"9\" data-x=\"87.273\" data-y=\"87.695\" aria-label=\"9: Open license notices\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-25-9\">9<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>About.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Version<\/b> <span>The app version on this computer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Maker<\/b> <span>XZ Mods is made by OpticMystic.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>App updates and release notes<\/b> <span>Opens App updates.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>The maker<\/b> <span>OpticMystic's projects: XZ Mods, VJ.Tools and DJ Profile. Make yours opens DJ Profile.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Links<\/b> <span>The source code, issues and releases on GitHub, xzmods.com and vj.tools. Each opens in your browser.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Feedback<\/b> <span>Opens <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"feedback\">Feedback<\/a> in the app.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Support XZ Mods (optional)<\/b> <span>Voluntary support on Cash App. Every feature stays available.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Disclaimers<\/b> <span>XZ Mods is independent of Pioneer DJ and AlphaTheta, experimental, runs from the USB, and builds its loader from the official firmware for your own use.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"9\" id=\"f-desktop-app-25-9\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><div><b>Open license notices<\/b> <span>Every open-source project XZ Mods uses and its license.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<h3 id=\"m-feedback\" data-anchor=\"feedback\">Feedback<\/h3>\n<p>Feedback is where you tell the maintainer about a problem, ask for a feature or ask a question, and follow what you sent. It sits at the foot of the rail on every page.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Feedback<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/c26f79e7209c6e6e.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Feedback section.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"13.636\" data-y=\"86.184\" aria-label=\"1: Feedback\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-26-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"42.000\" data-y=\"27.895\" aria-label=\"2: Report a problem\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-26-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"65.545\" data-y=\"27.895\" aria-label=\"3: Request a feature\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-26-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"87.545\" data-y=\"27.895\" aria-label=\"4: Ask a question\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-26-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"31.818\" data-y=\"42.368\" aria-label=\"5: My reports\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-26-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"42.364\" data-y=\"89.474\" aria-label=\"6: Maintainer inbox\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-26-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The Feedback section.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Feedback<\/b> <span>Opens this section from any page. A count on it shows reports from your XZ that wait for your words.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Report a problem<\/b> <span>Opens the report window at its first question.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Request a feature<\/b> <span>Opens the report window at the kind of idea.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Ask a question<\/b> <span>Goes straight to the box. Answers from this manual appear as you type.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>My reports<\/b> <span>What you sent from this computer and where each report is now.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-26-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Maintainer inbox<\/b> <span>For the maintainer only.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Reports from your XZ that wait for your words appear above My reports, under <strong>From your XZ<\/strong>. The sticks that may send them are listed under <strong>Your XZ sticks<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-report-a-problem-or-share-an-idea\" data-anchor=\"report-a-problem-or-share-an-idea\">Report a problem or share an idea<\/h4>\n<p>The report window sends a private report to the maintainer: a problem, something that got worse, an idea or a question. <strong>Report a problem<\/strong> in Feedback opens it at the first question. <strong>Request a feature<\/strong> and <strong>Ask a question<\/strong> answer that question for you. The only thing you have to fill in is one box. Nothing is posted publicly.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-27\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Report a problem or share an idea<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b7eee04d9848b2f8.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The first question.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"55.636\" data-y=\"16.842\" aria-label=\"1: Steps\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-27-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"37.727\" data-y=\"31.974\" aria-label=\"2: Topic\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-27-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"32.091\" data-y=\"70.000\" aria-label=\"3: How do I...?\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-27-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"66.818\" data-y=\"82.895\" aria-label=\"4: Not sure\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-27-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"26.909\" data-y=\"82.895\" aria-label=\"5: Cancel\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-27-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The first question.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-27-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Steps<\/b> <span>Where you are. The box with Send is always the last step.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-27-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Topic<\/b> <span>Pick the closest one. The next question depends on it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-27-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>How do I...?<\/b> <span>For a question. Answers from this manual appear as you type.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-27-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Not sure<\/b> <span>Skips the question. Every question has it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-27-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Cancel<\/b> <span>Closes the window. What you typed comes back when you open it again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li>Pick what it is about, or <strong>Not sure<\/strong>.<\/li><li>Answer at most two more short questions, or press <strong>Not sure<\/strong>.<\/li><li>Write what happened in your own words. One sentence is enough.<\/li><li>Press <strong>Send privately<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ol>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>You pick<\/th><th>It then asks<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Something got worse<\/td><td>When it got worse, then for the USB sticks that were in the XZ<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Something isn't working<\/td><td>What kind of problem: sound, SYNC or tempo, the screen, buttons and pads, loading and USB, four decks, a crash, or something else<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>It should work differently<\/td><td>Compared with what: the XZ before XZ Mods, another XZ feature, other DJ gear or software, an earlier XZ Mods version, or just your preference. For gear or another feature, which one<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>I have a new idea<\/td><td>What kind of idea<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>How do I...?<\/td><td>Nothing more. Go straight to your question<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Report a problem or share an idea<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/804f9f0cbc6c0586.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The box, with an answer from this manual.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"60.364\" data-y=\"19.342\" aria-label=\"1: Your answers\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-28-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"74.545\" data-y=\"25.000\" aria-label=\"2: The box\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-28-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"47.636\" data-y=\"49.737\" aria-label=\"3: Is this it?\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-28-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"44.455\" data-y=\"64.737\" aria-label=\"4: Answer buttons\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-28-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"35.273\" data-y=\"72.895\" aria-label=\"5: Included details\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-28-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"70.091\" data-y=\"85.000\" aria-label=\"6: Send privately\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-28-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The box, with an answer from this manual.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Your answers<\/b> <span>What you picked. Change goes back to the first question.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>The box<\/b> <span>The only thing you have to fill in. Up to 4,096 bytes; a counter appears near the limit.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Is this it?<\/b> <span>Up to three answers from this manual that match what you typed.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Answer buttons<\/b> <span>Set up four decks opens that setup. That answers it closes without sending anything.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Included details<\/b> <span>What the app collected to send with your words. Closed until you open it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-28-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Send privately<\/b> <span>Sends your words and the details shown, to the maintainer only.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>As you type, <strong>Is this it?<\/strong> shows answers from this manual. The matching runs on your computer; your words are not sent anywhere for it. If an answer solves it, its button opens the right setup, such as <strong>Set up four decks<\/strong>, or <strong>That answers it<\/strong> closes the window. Nothing is sent.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-included-details\" data-anchor=\"included-details\">Included details<\/h4>\n<p>While you answer and type, the app reads the details that help the maintainer, for at most 10 seconds: the session log and settings on your XZ Mods USB, the diary on each stick, the app's events and the build. Everything is cleaned first. No track names, file paths, serial numbers or network addresses are kept.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-29\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Included details<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/7d388107680af311.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Included details, opened, with one source shown and one left out.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"35.273\" data-y=\"6.842\" aria-label=\"1: Included details\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-29-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"36.455\" data-y=\"20.658\" aria-label=\"2: A source\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-29-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"69.273\" data-y=\"22.105\" aria-label=\"3: Show\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-29-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"39.455\" data-y=\"28.421\" aria-label=\"4: Left out\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-29-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"63.636\" data-y=\"38.158\" aria-label=\"5: Exact content\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-29-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Included details, opened, with one source shown and one left out.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-29-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Included details<\/b> <span>How many sources are included, their size and the time around the problem they cover.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-29-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>A source<\/b> <span>What it is and where it comes from. Untick it to leave it out.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-29-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Show<\/b> <span>The exact content that would be sent for this source.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-29-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Left out<\/b> <span>An unticked source is not sent.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-29-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Exact content<\/b> <span>What is sent for this source, after cleaning.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p><strong>Send privately<\/strong> sends exactly your words and the ticked details shown at that moment. If you send before the app has finished reading, it sends what it has read and notes what is missing. <strong>Collect again<\/strong> reads everything again. Ideas include no details at all, only your words. Details are deleted after 14 days.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-when-something-got-worse\" data-anchor=\"when-something-got-worse\">When something got worse<\/h4>\n<p>For something that got worse, the app asks you to plug in every USB stick that was in the XZ when it happened. XZ Mods versions that keep a diary write it to each stick while the XZ plays. The app reads only that diary, never your music.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-30\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Report a problem or share an idea<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/fc94bb3428bf4df4.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Two sticks plugged in: an XZ Mods USB with a diary and a music stick without one.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"47.273\" data-y=\"46.579\" aria-label=\"1: XZ Mods USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-30-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"39.636\" data-y=\"49.868\" aria-label=\"2: Diary\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-30-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"38.636\" data-y=\"57.368\" aria-label=\"3: Music stick\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-30-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"40.273\" data-y=\"60.658\" aria-label=\"4: No diary on this stick\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-30-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"69.273\" data-y=\"66.447\" aria-label=\"5: That&#x27;s all of them\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-30-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Two sticks plugged in: an XZ Mods USB with a diary and a music stick without one.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-30-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>XZ Mods USB<\/b> <span>A stick with the XZ Mods loader on it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-30-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Diary<\/b> <span>The time range the diary on this stick covers.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-30-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Music stick<\/b> <span>A stick with music only.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-30-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>No diary on this stick<\/b> <span>This stick has no diary, for example from a version that does not keep one.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-30-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>That's all of them<\/b> <span>Goes on to the box.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Each stick appears by itself as you plug it in. Press <strong>That's all of them<\/strong> when every stick is in. A missing stick or a missing diary never stops you sending.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-after-you-send\" data-anchor=\"after-you-send\">After you send<\/h4>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-31\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Report received<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/d8c900d0a51d5706.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The receipt after sending.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"50.545\" data-y=\"37.500\" aria-label=\"1: Your reference\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-31-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"47.182\" data-y=\"40.658\" aria-label=\"2: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-31-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"52.273\" data-y=\"44.868\" aria-label=\"3: Copy\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-31-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"62.545\" data-y=\"62.763\" aria-label=\"4: Track my report\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-31-4\">4<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The receipt after sending.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-31-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Your reference<\/b> <span>The permanent reference for this report, also shown in My reports.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-31-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>Where the report is now.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-31-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Copy<\/b> <span>Copies the reference so you can quote it to the maintainer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-31-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Track my report<\/b> <span>Opens it in My reports.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Every accepted report or idea gets its own reference, such as <strong>R-4F7K-2M9Q<\/strong>. Quote it when asking about that report. <strong>Copy<\/strong> copies the reference. The reference stays the same if you send again after a connection failure. It does not let anyone read your report or its status.<\/p>\n<p>If the app cannot confirm that a report arrived, it says <strong>Not confirmed yet<\/strong>. Nothing is lost. <strong>Set up reporting connection<\/strong> checks the internet connection and the computer's clock, then <strong>Send again<\/strong> sends the same report. If the first attempt did arrive, you get its receipt and nothing arrives twice. <strong>Save to a file<\/strong> keeps a copy without sending.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-32\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Set up reporting connection<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/a34f50e271839a07.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The setup after a send that was not confirmed.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"52.182\" data-y=\"40.263\" aria-label=\"1: Connection\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-32-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"41.091\" data-y=\"47.763\" aria-label=\"2: Clock\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-32-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"71.000\" data-y=\"72.500\" aria-label=\"3: Send again\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-32-3\">3<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The setup after a send that was not confirmed.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-32-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Connection<\/b> <span>Whether this computer is online.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-32-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Clock<\/b> <span>Secure connections fail when the date is wrong.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-32-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Send again<\/b> <span>Sends the same report again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<h4 id=\"m-my-reports\" data-anchor=\"my-reports\">My reports<\/h4>\n<p>My reports lists every report and idea sent from this computer, with its kind and where it is now, in plain words. It is the list under the buttons in Feedback.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-33\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · My reports<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/ff4a90b3eeb95f5f.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Four reports, one with news.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"30.727\" data-y=\"33.947\" aria-label=\"1: Kind\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-33-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"60.727\" data-y=\"32.237\" aria-label=\"2: Your words\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-33-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"53.273\" data-y=\"67.763\" aria-label=\"3: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-33-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"81.182\" data-y=\"33.684\" aria-label=\"4: Reference and date\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-33-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"84.545\" data-y=\"20.395\" aria-label=\"5: Check now\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-33-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Four reports, one with news.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-33-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Kind<\/b> <span>Such as Problem, Got worse, Works differently, Idea or Question.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-33-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Your words<\/b> <span>The start of what you wrote. It stays on this computer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-33-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>Where the report is now. New marks a change you have not opened yet.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-33-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Reference and date<\/b> <span>Your report reference and the day you sent it. Part of XZ-1042 appears when the maintainer assigns an item.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-33-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Check now<\/b> <span>Checks every report at once, and asks for new reports from your XZ.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>When a report's status changes, a notice appears at the top of whichever page is open.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-34\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · App updates<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/a58a8fd15208ae88.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A status change, shown while App updates is open.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"22.545\" data-y=\"16.447\" aria-label=\"1: Notice\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-34-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"55.727\" data-y=\"16.447\" aria-label=\"2: View\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-34-2\">2<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>A status change, shown while App updates is open.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-34-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Notice<\/b> <span>Appears when the status of one of your reports changes.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-34-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>View<\/b> <span>Opens that report.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>The app checks for news when it starts, after it checks for app updates, and when you open My reports, at most every 15 minutes for each report. <strong>Check now<\/strong> checks at once. If you are offline, the last known status stays.<\/p>\n<p>Open a report to see where it is. The view is read-only. Once the maintainer assigns it, <strong>Part of XZ-1042<\/strong> names the bug, feature or question it belongs to. Reports about the same item share that item number. If the maintainer moves your report to another item, this number changes; your R reference stays the same. Item numbers remain after the report's details are deleted.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · My reports<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/69e626273f50ba7e.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A problem the maintainer confirmed, with a fix in progress.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"50.000\" data-y=\"23.289\" aria-label=\"1: Progress\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"42.455\" data-y=\"31.316\" aria-label=\"2: Reference\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"46.364\" data-y=\"40.658\" aria-label=\"3: Your words\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"38.909\" data-y=\"46.711\" aria-label=\"4: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"54.545\" data-y=\"55.921\" aria-label=\"5: Dates\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"40.273\" data-y=\"65.395\" aria-label=\"6: Status link and forgetting\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"64.636\" data-y=\"68.947\" aria-label=\"7: Check now\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"33.636\" data-y=\"35.132\" aria-label=\"8: Part of\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-35-8\">8<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>A problem the maintainer confirmed, with a fix in progress.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Progress<\/b> <span>Received, Confirmed, Fix in progress, Ready to test, In an update. Ideas and questions show Received, Looked at, Decided.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Reference<\/b> <span>This report's permanent reference and kind.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Your words<\/b> <span>The start of what you wrote.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>Where it is now, in plain words.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Dates<\/b> <span>When you sent it, the last change, when its details are deleted and how long tracking lasts.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Status link and forgetting<\/b> <span>The status link, and Forget this report.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Check now<\/b> <span>Checks this report at once.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-35-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Part of<\/b> <span>The item this report belongs to, such as XZ-1042.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ul><li>If the maintainer needs one more detail, the question appears in the report. <strong>Answer in a new report<\/strong> starts a report that names this one.<\/li><li><strong>Open status page<\/strong> and <strong>Copy status link<\/strong> give a read-only web page with the same status, report reference and item number. It shows none of your words or details. Anyone with the link can read the status. <strong>Turn off status links<\/strong> stops every link for this report; the app still checks it.<\/li><li><strong>Forget this report<\/strong> removes its receipt from this computer. The maintainer keeps the report.<\/li><li>A report saved, but not sent, by an older version of the app appears under <strong>Saved, not sent<\/strong>. <strong>Use this text<\/strong> starts a new report with its words.<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>Details are deleted 14 days after you send them. Tracking lasts while a report is open, up to one year without news, then 180 days after it closes. A fix in a local test build is not a published update.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-from-your-xz\" data-anchor=\"from-your-xz\">From your XZ<\/h4>\n<p>A report sent from the XZ waits in Feedback for your words. <strong>From your XZ<\/strong> appears above My reports while one waits. The XZ notes the screen you were on as names only. It keeps no picture and no text from the screen.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · My reports<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/23385fbd30167c28.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A report from the XZ, waiting for your words.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"50.545\" data-y=\"6.316\" aria-label=\"1: From your XZ\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"61.455\" data-y=\"15.526\" aria-label=\"2: Reference and time\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"60.182\" data-y=\"22.105\" aria-label=\"3: Screen\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"55.091\" data-y=\"24.737\" aria-label=\"4: Stick\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"54.273\" data-y=\"27.368\" aria-label=\"5: Typed on the XZ\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"87.273\" data-y=\"44.079\" aria-label=\"6: What happened?\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"39.636\" data-y=\"54.737\" aria-label=\"7: Collected details\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"35.636\" data-y=\"61.711\" aria-label=\"8: Stop reminding\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-8\">8<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"9\" data-x=\"75.455\" data-y=\"66.184\" aria-label=\"9: Send without comments\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-9\">9<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"10\" data-x=\"88.364\" data-y=\"66.184\" aria-label=\"10: Send\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-36-10\">10<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>A report from the XZ, waiting for your words.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>From your XZ<\/b> <span>Reports from your XZ that wait for your words.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Reference and time<\/b> <span>The report's reference and when the XZ sent it. It stays the same when you add your words.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Screen<\/b> <span>The screen the XZ showed just before you reported, with any error code on it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Stick<\/b> <span>The stick the report came from, and when XZ Mods wrote it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Typed on the XZ<\/b> <span>What you typed on the XZ, if anything.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>What happened?<\/b> <span>Starts with what you typed on the XZ. Change it or add to it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Collected details<\/b> <span>What the XZ collected and sent with the report. Show displays each part exactly.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>Stop reminding<\/b> <span>Ends the reminders for this report. It stays in the list.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"9\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-9\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><div><b>Send without comments<\/b> <span>Finishes the report without words from you.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"10\" id=\"f-desktop-app-36-10\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><div><b>Send<\/b> <span>Adds your words to the same report.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ul><li><strong>Send<\/strong> adds your words to the same report, under the same reference. The report then moves to your sent reports, where you follow it like any other.<\/li><li><strong>Send without comments<\/strong> finishes the report as it is.<\/li><li>If the app can't reach the report service, it keeps your words and sends them by itself later. You can close the app.<\/li><li>The XZ already sent the collected details. They are deleted 14 days after it sent them. After that the report says so, and your words still reach the maintainer.<\/li><li>The maintainer sees the report as soon as the XZ sends it, marked as waiting for your comments, and can start from the logs.<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>The app tells you when a report from the XZ waits:<\/p>\n<ul><li>While the app is open, a new report brings a Windows notification, such as \"Your XZ sent a report, R-4F7K-2M9Q. Add what happened?\" Click it to open that report.<\/li><li><strong>Feedback<\/strong> in the rail shows how many reports wait.<\/li><li>When the app starts with reports waiting, a callout under the page title names them.<\/li><\/ul>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-37\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · From your XZ<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/bff533e9031c73c5.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The callout when the app starts with a report waiting.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"42.909\" data-y=\"19.737\" aria-label=\"1: Callout\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-37-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"69.273\" data-y=\"19.737\" aria-label=\"2: Add what happened\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-37-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"80.818\" data-y=\"18.289\" aria-label=\"3: Remind me later\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-37-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"90.000\" data-y=\"18.289\" aria-label=\"4: Stop reminding\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-37-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"21.818\" data-y=\"83.684\" aria-label=\"5: Badge\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-37-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The callout when the app starts with a report waiting.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-37-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Callout<\/b> <span>Names the report your XZ sent. It never covers the window or takes the keyboard.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-37-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Add what happened<\/b> <span>Opens the report in Feedback with its box ready.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-37-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Remind me later<\/b> <span>Hides the callout until the app starts again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-37-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Stop reminding<\/b> <span>Ends the reminders for these reports. They stay in Feedback.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-37-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Badge<\/b> <span>How many reports from your XZ wait for your words.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Reminders end when you choose <strong>Stop reminding<\/strong>, or 7 days after a report arrives. Each report brings one notification at most. If Windows notifications are off for XZ Mods, or your copy of the app is not installed, the badge and the callout tell you instead.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-your-xz-sticks\" data-anchor=\"your-xz-sticks\">Your XZ sticks<\/h4>\n<p>Every stick XZ Mods writes gets a loader ID, such as <strong>L-7K2M-9Q4F<\/strong>. It lets the XZ send reports from that stick to this computer, and to nothing else. <strong>Your XZ sticks<\/strong>, near the bottom of Feedback, lists them.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-38\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · My reports<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/05dbd1b4607ebe89.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Three sticks: one waiting to register, one ready and one revoked.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"33.909\" data-y=\"55.000\" aria-label=\"1: Your XZ sticks\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-38-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"38.364\" data-y=\"63.947\" aria-label=\"2: Loader ID\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-38-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"39.364\" data-y=\"66.974\" aria-label=\"3: Written\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-38-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"81.182\" data-y=\"68.026\" aria-label=\"4: State\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-38-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"90.636\" data-y=\"78.289\" aria-label=\"5: Revoke\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-38-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Three sticks: one waiting to register, one ready and one revoked.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-38-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Your XZ sticks<\/b> <span>The sticks XZ Mods wrote on this computer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-38-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Loader ID<\/b> <span>Reports from this stick carry it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-38-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Written<\/b> <span>When XZ Mods last wrote the stick.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-38-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>State<\/b> <span>Can send reports, Registers when online, Plug it in to finish, Revokes when online or Revoked.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-38-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Revoke<\/b> <span>Stops this stick sending reports. The app asks first.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ul><li>Revoke a stick you lost or gave away. The XZ can no longer send reports from it. If you are offline, the stick is revoked on this computer at once and the report service hears of it later.<\/li><li>Writing XZ Mods to that stick again gives it a new key, and it can send reports again.<\/li><li><strong>Plug it in to finish<\/strong> means a write to that stick was not confirmed. Plug the stick in with the app open. If the state stays, write XZ Mods to the stick again.<\/li><li>With no sticks yet, <strong>Set up a USB<\/strong> opens the USB setup.<\/li><\/ul>\n<h4 id=\"m-maintainer-inbox\" data-anchor=\"maintainer-inbox\">Maintainer inbox<\/h4>\n<p><strong>Maintainer inbox<\/strong>, at the bottom of Feedback, is for the maintainer. Connect it with the report-only owner key. The short setup checks that key by reading the inbox.<\/p>\n<p>Enter a report reference or item number in the search box and choose <strong>Find<\/strong>. You can type either case, with or without spaces and dashes. For a report reference, I or L also means 1, and O means 0. A report reference finds one report; an item number finds the reports assigned to that item. <strong>Clear<\/strong> returns to the inbox.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-39\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Maintainer inbox<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/db433d70afc009a5.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The inbox, scrolled right to show Reference and Item.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"90.636\" data-y=\"18.553\" aria-label=\"1: Find\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-39-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"70.364\" data-y=\"31.053\" aria-label=\"2: Reference\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-39-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"90.091\" data-y=\"31.053\" aria-label=\"3: Item\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-39-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"60.909\" data-y=\"78.158\" aria-label=\"4: Scroll\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-39-4\">4<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The inbox, scrolled right to show Reference and Item.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-39-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Find<\/b> <span>Searches the whole inbox by report reference or item number.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-39-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Reference<\/b> <span>The permanent reference for each report.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-39-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Item<\/b> <span>The bug, feature or question the report belongs to. A dash means it has not been assigned yet.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-39-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Scroll<\/b> <span>Scroll right or left to see every column.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>The reference and item number identify a report; the owner key is still required to read the inbox.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-manual\" data-anchor=\"manual\">Manual<\/h3>\n<p>Manual is this manual, inside the app. It comes with the app, so it needs no internet connection. Where the app explains a feature, <strong>Read in the manual<\/strong> opens the chapter about it.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf mf--app\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">XZ Mods app · Manual<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/470c26c588778788.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Four decks open in the Manual, at the video of how the sound of decks 3 and 4 reaches the mixer.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"16.364\" data-y=\"39.474\" aria-label=\"1: Manual\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"44.727\" data-y=\"2.763\" aria-label=\"2: Search\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"40.909\" data-y=\"9.605\" aria-label=\"3: Progress\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"34.545\" data-y=\"19.079\" aria-label=\"4: Start page\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"39.091\" data-y=\"59.474\" aria-label=\"5: Chapter list\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"97.455\" data-y=\"3.947\" aria-label=\"6: Chapter\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"91.818\" data-y=\"55.263\" aria-label=\"7: Video\" aria-describedby=\"f-desktop-app-40-7\">7<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Four decks open in the Manual, at the video of how the sound of decks 3 and 4 reaches the mixer.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Manual<\/b> <span>Opens the manual. It sits between Tools and Feedback in the rail.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Search<\/b> <span>Searches every chapter as you type. Press / to get here from anywhere on the page, and Enter to open the first result.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Progress<\/b> <span>How much of the manual you have read. A chapter's circle fills as you read and turns into a tick at its end.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Start page<\/b> <span>What XZ Mods adds, the interface you play on, and every chapter in order.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Chapter list<\/b> <span>Every chapter. The one you are reading is outlined and lists its sections.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Chapter<\/b> <span>The chapter you are reading. Previous and Next at its end move through the manual in order.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-desktop-app-40-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>Video<\/b> <span>A clip rendered from a true-scale model of the XDJ-XZ shows how a feature works. It plays when it comes into view, and Play pauses it. A video in several steps also has arrows and numbered steps, and its caption follows the step.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ul><li><strong>Numbers on pictures.<\/strong> Point at a number, or tab to it and use the arrow keys, to light up that part of the picture and read what it is. <strong>Play<\/strong> steps through every number. The list under the picture says the same.<\/li><li><strong>Your interface.<\/strong> Choose MODERN, CLASSIC or Both on the start page or at the foot of the chapter list. The manual then hides what does not apply to you. A MODS page drawn in both interfaces has a MODERN and CLASSIC switch on its picture.<\/li><li><strong>Where you stopped.<\/strong> The manual remembers the chapter and section you read last. The start page offers <strong>Continue where you left off<\/strong>.<\/li><li><strong>Less motion.<\/strong> When your computer is set to reduce motion, nothing in the manual moves by itself. A video shows a still picture of each step and plays only when you press Play.<\/li><\/ul>";
